    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c3f10e01-3b1e-371e-8ddc-590239b09712",
                "word": "uppermost",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "233f5d20-3c3c-39d3-9fdd-d18add2d30a5",
                        "entry_id": "c3f10e01-3b1e-371e-8ddc-590239b09712",
                        "glosses": [
                            "At or nearest the top of something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c28e7572-7906-4aba-9f73-cb7aaf94a243",
                                "sense_id": "233f5d20-3c3c-39d3-9fdd-d18add2d30a5",
                                "text": "Well, to me, if you are restricting it to economic policy — because I can surely think of some noneconomic policy concerns that are more uppermost in my mind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26b6d9ea-c093-4ffa-a5d2-9fae2ed7765a",
                                "sense_id": "233f5d20-3c3c-39d3-9fdd-d18add2d30a5",
                                "text": "As a result, it is not always an easy matter to evaluate, as an outsider, the effectiveness of a life-task strategy (i.e., sometimes the objective indicators of success and failure do not coincide with the goals most uppermost in a person's mind)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8e333c0-b221-3837-9f80-7a971a988cba",
                        "entry_id": "c3f10e01-3b1e-371e-8ddc-590239b09712",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Highest in rank, importance, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d49fb0b2-4b96-45c9-bc9e-4068b027e747",
                                "sense_id": "d8e333c0-b221-3837-9f80-7a971a988cba",
                                "text": "This brings me to the uppermost problem for over-60-year-old lesbians. Loneliness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cea2bd8-cb5d-46a8-af87-b3fd08751ae4",
                                "sense_id": "d8e333c0-b221-3837-9f80-7a971a988cba",
                                "text": "For him, as for his colleagues, concern with priestly comportment and purity is uppermost."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1829cea5-1cc0-41f8-b6c7-0c07e6214449",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f10e01-3b1e-371e-8ddc-590239b09712",
                        "source_sense_description": "at or nearest the top",
                        "target_lang_word": "bovenst",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
